      "description": "Authentication endpoints for client and agency accounts using Laravel Sanctum.\n\n### Client Registration\n\n`POST /api/register/client`\n\nCreates a new client account.\n\nRequired fields:\n\n- first_name\n    \n- last_name\n    \n- email\n    \n- password\n    \n- password_confirmation\n    \n\nOptional fields:\n\n- phone\n    \n\nThe created user receives:\n\n- role: client\n    \n- status: active\n    \n\n### Agency Registration\n\n`POST /api/register/agency`\n\nCreates an agency owner account and the associated agency profile.\n\nRequired fields:\n\n- first_name\n    \n- last_name\n    \n- email\n    \n- password\n    \n- password_confirmation\n    \n- phone\n    \n- agency_name\n    \n- agency_city\n    \n- address\n    \n- agency_phone\n    \n\nThe created user receives:\n\n- role: agency\n    \n- status: active\n    \n\nThe created agency receives:\n\n- status: pending\n    \n\nOptional fields:\n\n- phone\n    \n\nAgency registration is executed inside a database transaction to ensure data consistency.\n\n### Login\n\n`POST /api/login`\n\nAuthenticates a user using email and password.\n\nOn successful authentication, the API returns:\n\n- User information\n    \n- Sanctum access token\n    \n\nSuspended accounts are not allowed to log in.\n\n### Status Codes\n\n- `200` Successful request\n    \n- `201` Resource created successfully\n    \n- `401` Invalid credentials or unauthenticated\n    \n- `403` Account suspended or access forbidden\n    \n- `422` Validation error"
